  "probeBugFoundAndFixed": {
    "date": "2026-09-07T00:33:33.255Z",
    "bug": "probe.html allocN() created the tsCopyRun staging buffer with usage MAP_WRITE|COPY_SRC|COPY_DST — spec-invalid (MAP_WRITE may only combine with COPY_SRC). Dawn rejected creation; every subsequent staging writeBuffer/copyBufferToBuffer cascaded [Invalid Buffer] device errors, which failed renderCheck (zero-errors requirement) on the pre-fix run even though cell checksums were unaffected.",
    "fix": "staging usage reduced to COPY_SRC|COPY_DST (writeBuffer needs COPY_DST, copyBufferToBuffer needs COPY_SRC; no mapping used). Post-fix runs: 0 device errors, renderCheck passed.",
    "note": "The Node mock-device validation (45/45 bit-exact) could not catch a usage-flag spec violation — only real Dawn under browser tooling did. This is part of the task 3.4 payoff."
  },
